{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Touhou: Divine Land -Majesty in Game-",
    "steam_appid": 3406890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/cda8cffe518a7aa6ecc5df3d4584d63b.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: main Chapter (10 chapters), side stages, special stages, challenge stages, Clearance Bonus, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter contains about 5-6 main stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/4df19caac966a4a989d7fe1ad4447cbd.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 characters can be used finally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/22127c71b199bbae3d6df68ca41fc620.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character upgrade, character talent, weapon proficiency and level, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapon skills, equipment .etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through character cultivation, and the combination of different professional cultivation, equipped skills, etc., skill matching is carried out to finally create a hexagonal warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports two modes: [Fixed Point Addition] and [Random Point Addition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/c1f5f3a3352b8b6a0012abb566640d9a.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/2a00e1cae78d9ddc02481e08efa5bfd2.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the developers: There are 2 menbers in total, and another friend helps write plugins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the music part, there are commercial free and paid/free licenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art: Character drawing, CGAI and post-production modification, pure post-production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > production of the figurines, map AI and the editing of the authorized unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/cda8cffe518a7aa6ecc5df3d4584d63b.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: main Chapter (10 chapters), side stages, special stages, challenge stages, Clearance Bonus, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter contains about 5-6 main stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/4df19caac966a4a989d7fe1ad4447cbd.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 characters can be used finally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/22127c71b199bbae3d6df68ca41fc620.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character upgrade, character talent, weapon proficiency and level, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapon skills, equipment .etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through character cultivation, and the combination of different professional cultivation, equipped skills, etc., skill matching is carried out to finally create a hexagonal warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports two modes: [Fixed Point Addition] and [Random Point Addition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/c1f5f3a3352b8b6a0012abb566640d9a.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/2a00e1cae78d9ddc02481e08efa5bfd2.avif?t=1753167710\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the developers: There are 2 menbers in total, and another friend helps write plugins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the music part, there are commercial free and paid/free licenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art: Character drawing, CGAI and post-production modification, pure post-production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > production of the figurines, map AI and the editing of the authorized unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Kawasiro Nitori created a multiplayer online MMO game and promoted it on TV. Remlia thought this was a good opportunity for the whole Gensokyo to worship her fame without leaving her house.",
